{"version":1,"content":"<p>教宗良十四世患上肺腺癌【相關報道】。</p><p>肺腺癌是肺癌的一種，屬最常見的非小細胞肺癌（NSCLC）類型。</p><p>約70%的肺腺癌個案與基因突變相關。</p><p>早期肺腺癌經手術治療後，5年存活率可高達80%。</p><p>本文綜合香港防癌會及癌症基金會資料，助大家認識肺腺癌。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.951133+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T02:26:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416728+00:00","content_hash":"04cc517ee2ad57fd40f6b0c6756107ee868caa3ddbba48bf71bdb20d90a67e93","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}